      "result": "passed",
      "summary": "PNG generated: 1536 x 1024, 8-bit RGB"
    },
    {
      "command": "grep -c '—\\|–' design-concepts/10-smoke-silver/DESIGN.md",
      "result": "passed",
      "summary": "0 em-dash / en-dash characters found"
    }
  ],
  "validationOutput": [
    "DESIGN.md contains all 10 mandated sections in order",
    "Palette uses blue-tinted cool neutrals only; single electric blue accent (oklch 0.55 0.15 258 light, 0.72 0.14 258 dark)",
    "One radius system (rounded-sm/lg/xl family, no pills)",
    "min-h-[100dvh] / h-[calc(100dvh-3.5rem)], never h-screen",
    "RTL-first: sidebar on right (start) side in wireframe",
    "Glassmorphism limited to input + callouts with solid fallback under prefers-reduced-transparency",
    "hero.png renders (rsvg-convert exit 0, valid PNG)"
  ],
  "residualRisks": [
    "Hero mockup is a stylized SVG wireframe, not a photoreal generated image; parent may want to regenerate hero.png with image_gen after selection (image_gen tool not in worker toolset)",
    "Arabic glyphs in SVG rely on system font fallback; actual app fonts (Tajawal/Uthmanic) may render differently in browser"
  ],
  "noStagedFiles": true,
  "diffSummary": "Added design-concepts/10-smoke-silver/ (DESIGN.md + hero.svg + hero.png) and updated the delegated progress file; nothing staged in git",
